# Chaos: the Graphics and Interface tabs of the Options window scroll (client/BASE.md "0156"; mods/client_settings/options/
# graphics.otui, options/interface.otui; after 0001-0154). OTUI only, no engine code.
# Bug (owner screenshot, Graphics tab with "Show Advanced Options"): the tab is a plain Panel that fills the 519 x 442 option
# area, and its FlatPanel groups are stacked below one another with fixed heights. The groups added since (rarity outline,
# orbs, the 371 px visual effects group of 0126, ...) sum to about 700 px, so the dark group backgrounds were drawn about
# 380 px below the window, over the game screen. The Interface tab (about 540 px of groups) had the same fault.
# Fix: the tab's rows move into a ScrollablePanel next to a VerticalScrollBar (the style the other lists of the window
# use); the window stays 442 px high and the tab scrolls. The Reset button was anchored to the tab's bottom edge; it now
# follows the last group (anchored to prev.bottom) so it scrolls with the rows. The first Interface group had no right
# anchor (a fixed 505 px) and now stretches to the narrower viewport like the others. Ids of all rows are unchanged
# (the options code finds them with recursiveGetChildById).
# Not run in a client; goes live with the next client build.
